      "writtenOn": "2024-03-14T14:23:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason for DICE policy error is because `policy_for_dice_chain()` method in libdice_policy_builder (which is a client side test) constructs a DICE policy that includes the EXACT_MATCH on the first entry.\n\nThe DICE policy set could very well have been to allow access to a DICE chain with a different UDS \u0026 Secretkeeper would release secret.\n\nSo really, this is testing is testing client library not the HAL behaviour. (It maybe be valuable to keep it if there is no other place to easily test this bevaviour, but I think #policy_structure_check at [1] tests this already).\n\n[1] https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/secretkeeper/dice_policy/tests/test.rs;l\u003d238-245",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 475,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 475,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "50b69fc3da0b580dda2d4cbfcc3175f35c5d6571",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
