      "side": 1,
      "message": "True, it is reliant on the particular DICE policy set in the test client.  But it tests the primary purpose of Secretkeeper (namely: keeping secrets secret), and it\u0027s somewhat different than the policy tests below, so I think it\u0027s worth having.",
